('A producer sends five frames into a two-frame bounded queue without a consumer. What does the example prove?','The overflow policy limits backlog; it does not prove speech quality.','All five frames are retained without extra memory.','The provider supports five simultaneous speakers.'),
('The model stops generating after an interruption, but queued sound continues. Which boundary failed?','The playback scheduler did not clear already scheduled audio.','The input microphone needs a larger history.','The token counter was not reset to zero.'),
