('Two embedding models return equal-length vectors. May their records share one similarity index contract?','Only after an explicit compatible-model decision/evaluation; equal dimensions alone do not establish compatibility.','Yes; matching dimensions imply semantic comparability.','Yes; cosine distance makes model versions irrelevant.'),
('A global nearest neighbor belongs to another tenant. What is a safe retrieval baseline?','Exact search inside the authenticated tenant/revision boundary.','Return it and hide its owner field.','Retrieve globally and ask the generator not to mention private text.'),
('Lexical and vector scores use different scales. Why use reciprocal-rank fusion?','It combines ranked positions without assuming raw score calibration.','It proves every top result is factually relevant.','It allows unauthorized candidates to be included if highly ranked.'),
('A reranker returns candidate index 7 when only five candidates were submitted. What happens?','Reject the invalid result rather than inventing a source mapping.','Use index modulo five to avoid an error.','Treat 7 as a document ID from the vector database.'),
('A response cites a real source but reverses its exception. Which check catches this?','Claim-level support review against the applicable evidence.','Citation membership alone.','Response JSON parsing alone.'),
('The browser disconnects after three draft deltas. Which record may be cached as a complete answer?','None until the complete event and output checks succeed.','The last received delta.','The concatenation of any nonempty deltas.'),
